                                                                                  "Campaigns"
                                                                              ],
                                                                     "operationId":  "getCampaignResults",
                                                                     "summary":  "Visit conversion and lift versus the control group",
                                                                     "description":  "Conversion is the share of recipients (`contact_log`) with at least one `countsAsPresence` event at the campaign target tenant within `(contactedAt, contactedAt + attributionDays]`. Lift is the difference between recipient and control group conversion; significance is a two-sample test of proportions. The control group baseline is measured from `export.createdAt`, because control members are not written to `contact_log`.",
